      <div class="terminal-note">
        <div class="note-head">&#9670; SUMMARY</div>
        <p>Adds a primary Postgres instance with a read replica in a second availability zone, plus a settlement queue holding four days of messages. The existing security group gains one ingress rule scoped to the new database, so nothing becomes publicly reachable.</p>
        <p>The replica is the largest share of the cost increase. Both instances sit inside the existing VPC, pinned to the network stack at head <span style="font-family:var(--mono);color:var(--yellow)">4b1e77</span>.</p>
